    "series_description": "A poignant story of familial connection, second chances, and finding solace in the unexpected support of loved ones.",
    "series_description_long": "---\ntitle: \"Jack And Sarah\"\npov: \n  - Jack Bennett (primary)\n  - Sarah Bennett\n  - Molly Bennett\n  - Clare Bennett\nlocation: Virginia Beach, VA\ncharacters:\n  - Jermaine: Jack and Sarah's father\n  - Devin: Jermaine's brother, father to identical twins Molly and Clare\ntimeline_notes: >\n  When Delores comes into the picture: she is the SAME Delores from /luna-leo. \n  The events of Jack & Sarah (at least the scenes involving Delores) take place \n  AFTER Delores gets back to Virginia, after abusing Leo.\n---\n\n# Jack & Sarah\n\nA poignant story of familial connection, second chances, and finding solace in the unexpected support of loved ones. Jack and Sarah's narrative explores the complexities of their family dynamic, the healing power of shared experiences, and the ways in which they help each other navigate life's most difficult moments. It is a deeply emotional journey of growth and resilience.",
